====== Medion Live NASserver P89625 (MD86407) ======
This is a low-cost single-port SATA NAS box sold in different configurations (1TB / 1.5TB / 2TB / 3TB).
It comes with a 1GE network port and 2x USB 2.0 host ports, one on the back and one on the front.
It's apparently manufactured by MitraStar Technology Corp. which belongs to Unizyx which belong to ZyXEL. The design name is STG-212. There are several hints that the Linux-based stock firmware was made be ZyXEL as well.

